Scenario: Add Organization Team
Priority: 4
	Given these properties
		|test.name.skip.portal.instance|CPUsersandorganizations#AddORganizationTeam|
	When ProductMenu goto Control Panel Configuration
		|portlet|Server Administration|
	And ServerAdministration execute Server Resources Actions
		|actionsDescription|Reindex all search indexes.|
	And ProductMenu goto Control Panel Users
		|portlet|Users and Organizations|
	And Organization add CP
		|orgName|Organization Name|
		|orgType|Organization|
	And ProductMenu goto Control Panel Users
		|portlet|Users and Organizations|
	And UsersAndOrganizationsNavigator goto Organizations
	And Organization add Site CP
		|orgName|Organization Name|
	And ProductMenu goto Control Panel Users
		|portlet|Users and Organizations|
	And UsersAndOrganizationsNavigator goto Organizations
	And Organization manage Membership Options In Sites
		|allowManualMembershipManagement|true|
		|orgName|Organization Name|
	And ProductMenu goto Control Panel Users
		|portlet|Users and Organizations|
	And UsersAndOrganizationsNavigator goto Organizations
	And Organization add Member CP
		|orgName|Organization Name|
		|userFirstName|Test|
		|userLastName|Test|
		|userName|Test Test|
		|userScreenName|test|
	And ProductMenu goto Control Panel Sites
		|portlet|Sites|
	And Page add
		|pageName|Organization Public Page|
		|siteName|Organization Name|
	And ProductMenu goto Site
		|site|Organization Name|
	And ProductMenu goto Sites Members
		|portlet|Site Teams|
	Then Team add CP
		|siteName|Organization Name|
		|teamDescription|Site Team Description|
		|teamName|Site Team Name|
